    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578290/extras/b7cbc771b0822a2bed1a5e830e3a7854.poster.avif?t=1755142992\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578290/extras/b7cbc771b0822a2bed1a5e830e3a7854.webm?t=1755142992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578290/extras/b7cbc771b0822a2bed1a5e830e3a7854.mp4?t=1755142992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578290/extras/b6528ea6819b2a0089755ff13d4a8cac.poster.avif?t=1755142992\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578290/extras/b6528ea6819b2a0089755ff13d4a8cac.webm?t=1755142992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578290/extras/b6528ea6819b2a0089755ff13d4a8cac.mp4?t=1755142992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ransom VonGarland must journey\u00a0to Mayhem Island and the ruins of VonGarland Castle to find her brother and uncover the truth of what Plasmadine\u00a0corporation is doing on the island\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >JOIN the DISCORD\u00a0\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578290/extras/ddf61c63c8793a6cae1192eed437dbd1.avif?t=1755142992\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578290/extras/4bd4c3b513b75caf83297041574c7539.poster.avif?t=1755142992\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578290/extras/4bd4c3b513b75caf83297041574c7539.webm?t=1755142992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578290/extras/4bd4c3b513b75caf83297041574c7539.mp4?t=1755142992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VGBB </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >is a survival horror action platformer with some Metroidvania elements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >super Metroid meets RE4.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you must fight your way through hordes of enemies and bosses and solve puzzles to reach VonGarland castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >find keys &amp; items to help you reach new\u00a0areas of Mayhem Island.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >discover new weapons\u00a0to defeat enemies more easily.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >conserve ammo by taking on enemies\u00a0in close combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>enter a world of\u00a0survival horror</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >*unlocked new awesome Weapons, Skills &amp; Powers!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >*find items, keys &amp; Cranks!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >*unlock new accessories and costumes</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578290/extras/8d70fd8a65b48cab244e3cd8b12a26e9.avif?t=1755142992\" data-has-big width=800 height=1305 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578290/extras/b7cbc771b0822a2bed1a5e830e3a7854.poster.avif?t=1755142992\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578290/extras/b7cbc771b0822a2bed1a5e830e3a7854.webm?t=1755142992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578290/extras/b7cbc771b0822a2bed1a5e830e3a7854.mp4?t=1755142992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578290/extras/b6528ea6819b2a0089755ff13d4a8cac.poster.avif?t=1755142992\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578290/extras/b6528ea6819b2a0089755ff13d4a8cac.webm?t=1755142992\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578290/extras/b6528ea6819b2a0089755ff13d4a8cac.mp4?t=1755142992\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ransom VonGarland must journey\u00a0to Mayhem Island and the ruins of VonGarland Castle to find her brother and uncover the truth of what Plasmadine\u00a0corporation is doing on the island\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >JOIN the DISCORD\u00a0\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3578290/extras/ddf61c63c8793a6cae1192eed437dbd1.avif?t=1755142992\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinl